# The Node.js runtime MSI. ~30 MB of vendor binary that is downloaded once on a
# connected machine and verified against nodejs.org's own SHASUMS256.txt. It is
# not ours to redistribute through source control, and a checked-in copy is a
# copy nobody re-verifies.
redist/

# Compiler output: the .exe itself, and whatever ISCC leaves beside it.
out/
